 to provide the best possible game feel.<br><br>The game received the &quot;Future Game of the Show&quot; award in the Tokyo Game Show 2010 and the script, noting some of the characters lines, got a gold mention on the Internet Buzzword Awards 2010 as well. The original aesthetics, the uniqueness of its concept and the feeling of being ahead its time (2011) were widely discussed on the international media.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Release notes:</h2>The game is fully dubbed in English, but subtitles in German, Spanish, Italian and French are also available on its worldwide release.", "short_description": "El Shaddai, originally released in 2011, is a unique third-person action adventure filled with a deeply artistic world-building, outstanding aesthetics and thrilling battles. Experience an incredible mix of 2D-like platformer action and a colorful 3D world in an exceptional setting.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581040/header.jpg?t=1775443461", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581040/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775443461", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581040/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775443461", "website": "http://crim.co.jp", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4200U（1.6GHz）<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4400<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8.2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "©crim", "developers": ["crim Co., Ltd."], "publishers": ["crim Co., Ltd.", "Gamirror Games"], "price